Z||000000||8Ball||12-02-2001||07:17 PM||||Ok I have followed the threads in the past on indiglo gauges. Well today while farting around my house I got an idea. We have these Indiglo nite lights in our house. We got them at Wal-Mart for 3.99 for 2. If they will work on 12v DC you could use them to replace the dash lights and thus giving you Indiglo looking backlit gauges.<P>What do ya think??<BR>E.B.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/8bff.gif"> ||||reg||1
