Z||000003||87GTZ34||12-02-2001||09:22 PM||||El likes frequency more than current.  I believe the optimum freq is 400Hz but I'll have to look it up.  I saw those lites when I was at Home Depot but didn't pick one up.  I had one when I was 6, it lasted about 3 days.  I unplugged it and bought it to bed on the top bunk after my mom left my room.  On the third day if fell out while I was asleep and didn't survive the fall...||||reg||1
